# Tablet of Discovery: "{T}: Add {R}{R}. Spend this mana only to cast instant and sorcery spells" (CR 106.6). Three Mox
# Rubies pay for the Tablet, which then taps for its restricted {R}{R}: the pool shows the restriction, and the two
# red mana pay for a Lightning Bolt (an instant) and a Chain Lightning (a sorcery), the Mountain's {R} staying untapped.
# Nothing else in the pool could have paid, so the spells prove the restricted mana pays for both kinds.

